      "modern_equivalent": "என்னுடைய",
      "english_word": "my",
      "source": "db_0ms"
    },
    {
      "verse": 11,
      "word": "சத்துரு",
      "pos": "noun",
      "canonical": "சத்துரு",
      "definition_ta": "எதிரி அல்லது பகைவன்.",
      "modern_equivalent": "எதிரி",
